Subject: [PATCH] expose complete command environment without Unicode filtering

Test helpers must scrub the complete PTY environment snapshot, including
registry-derived entries and non-Unicode keys and values, rather than only
the parent process environment or the Unicode-only iterator.

Issue: https://github.com/Smarty-Pants-Inc/smarty-dev/issues/2491
Upstream discussion: none
Upstream PR: none
Vendored base: portable-pty 0.9.0
---
